# Embedded libraries — load FIRST. LibSharedMedia surfaces textures/fonts other
# addons register into our picker; needs LibStub + CallbackHandler first.
# LibCustomGlow provides the aura glow effects (Autocast/Pixel/Proc/Action-
# Button) and needs LibStub. The minimap launcher retired with Phase D — the
# ONE suite button lives in GloomsHub (GS icon), so LDB + LibDBIcon are gone.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
